  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till lokala skogs befolkningars anpassning till klimatf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UICN Burkina /Adaptation of local forest populations to climate change 2016-2018 - PACOF-CC Studies&amp;Monitoring-SystemAudit2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IUCN har beg&#xe4;rt finansiellt st&#xf6;d om 22 MSEK fr&#xe5;n Sida f&#xf6;r att genomf&#xf6;ra projektet &quot;Support to local forest populations&apos; adaptation fo climate change&quot; under perioden 15 november 2016 - 31 december 2018.
Projektets syfte &#xe4;r att skapa ekologiska och socio-ekonomiska f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar f&#xf6;r st&#xe4;rkt kapacitet f&#xf6;r anpassning till klimatf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar hos den s&#xe5;rbara befolkningen i tv&#xe5; regioner i Burkina Faso. Projektet avser att f&#xe4;rdigst&#xe4;lla och till&#xe4;mpa instrument f&#xf6;r decentraliserad skogsf&#xf6;rvaltning i skogarna Sablogo respektive Soudougui samt i 12 agro-forestry-omr&#xe5;den.
Projektet f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas st&#xe4;rka motst&#xe5;ndskraften mot klimatf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar hos den &#xf6;verv&#xe4;gande del av lokalbefolkningen som &#xe4;r beroende av skog och skogsprodukter. 
IUCN &#xe4;r genomf&#xf6;rare av projektet i samarbete med milj&#xf6;ministeriets regionala direktorat i Centre-East resp Centre-West -regionerna, ber&#xf6;rda kommuner (Bissiga, Cassou, Lalgaye, Soudougui, Tenkodogo) samt lokala organisationer.
Budgeten uppg&#xe5;r till 22 MSEK varav cirka 53% avses att vidaref&#xf6;rmedlas till nationella partners.
-----------------------------
IUCN has applied to Sida for funding of 22 million SEK to carry out the project &quot;Support to local forest populations&apos; adaptation fo climate change&quot; during the period 15 november 2016 to December 2018. 

The overall objective of the project is to create ecological and socio-economic conditions to support the adaptive capacity to climate change of the riparian vulnerable communities in two regions of Burkina Faso. Specifically, it will finalize the development and implementation of decentralized management tools of the forests of Sablogo and Soudougui and 12 parklands;
The expected impact is the Reduction of the vulnerability for climate change of local populations depending on forests. IUCN will implement the intervention together with the Regional offices (Centre East and Centre West) of the ministry of environment, green economy and climate change (MEEVCC), the concerned communes (Bissiga, Cassou, Lalgaye, Soudougui, Tenkodogo) and non-governmental partner organisations.
The intervention&#x2019;s total budget is 22 million SEK. Approximately 53% of the intervention budget will be forwarded from IUCN to the implementing partners.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve economic and socio ecological bases of community forest sustainability for climate adaptation</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to contribute to creating ecological and socio-economic conditions favorable to the adaptation to climate change of vulnerable populations living in the community forests of the central west and central east regions of Burkina Faso.
The specific objectives are:
-&#xa0;to increase decentralized forest governance effectiveness in the Center East and Center East regions
-&#xa0;to skill, knowledge and/or equipment for the sustainable management of agrosilvopastoral and forest productions provided to three categories of actors in 5 intervention communes
- to strengthen socio-economic and ecological sustainability of forests and their areas of influence
- to increase carbon sequestration capacity by the target forests and agro-forest areas.</narrative>
  </description>
